#
# NOTE! Don't add files that are generated in specific
# subdirectories here. Add them in the ".gitignore" file
# in that subdirectory instead.
#
# NOTE! Please use 'git-ls-files -i --exclude-standard'
# command after changing this file, to see if there are
# any tracked files which get ignored after the change.
#
# Normal rules
#
.*
!.gitmodules
!.gitattributes
*.o
*.o.*
*.so
*.so.dbg
*.bin
*.gz

# [PATCH-ARCHIVE 2026-10-15] 允许归档"我们对上游模块的补丁"（默认 *.patch 被下面第 44 行忽略）
!dev/patches/*
!dev/patches/*.patch

#
# Top-level generic files
#
bin
build
build_linux
tags
TAGS
win
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!.travis.yml

#
# Build generated files
#
autom4te.cache

#
# Editors / debuggers / other output files
#
*~
*.bak
*.orig
*.patch
callgrind.out.*
nbproject/
.idea/
cmake-build-*/

#
# Git stuff
!.github/
# stgit directories
patches-*

#
# VS binaries output
#
bin/*

#
# VS temporary files
#
*.ncb
*.suo
*.sdf
*.opensdf
*.sln.cache
*.vsp
ipch
*.user
*.opendb
*.VC.db

#
# CMake temporary files
#
CMakeFiles
CMakeCache.txt
cmake_install.cmake

#
# OS specific
#
# MacOS
.DS_Store

#
# Special exceptions
#

# recastnavigation directory needs exception
!dep/recastnavigation/RecastDemo/Build/
/_build/

#
# Module files
#
# [SUBMODULE 2026-10-15] 原来这里是 `src/modules/`（整目录忽略），于是 PlayerBots 的本地修复
# 完全不被外层仓库跟踪，重 clone/reset 就会静默丢失。改为子模块跟踪：
#   .gitmodules 记录 https://github.com/Nightingale9002/playerbots.git
#   gitlink 记录我们分支 kabu-2026.10 的确切 commit
# 忽略只保留模块自身的构建产物（不忽略源码）。
src/modules/*/CMakeFiles/
src/modules/*/build/

#
# Python 探针运行产物（dev/tools/*.py 被 import 时生成的字节码缓存）
#
__pycache__/
*.pyc
#
# 卡布奇诺 fork 追加（2026-10-13）
# 教训：原有 `*.bak` 只匹配以此结尾的名字，`foo.md.bak_20261010` 这种漏网，
# 结果两个 852KB/78KB 的备份被提交进了公开仓库。用 *.bak_* 兜住。
#
*.bak_*
.bak_*
*.bak-*
# 明文凭据 / 密钥，一律不进仓库
*.cred
.replica_cred
*.pem
*.key
!src/game/Anticheat/module/warden_modules/*.key

# dev/tools 有自己的独立仓库（dev/tools/.git），外层不要再跟踪它，
# 否则 git add -A 会把内层仓库管的文件重复入库（2026-10-15）。
dev/tools/

# [SUBMODULE 2026-10-15] 本地裸仓库镜像（模块的兜底备份，不进外层仓库）
dev/hold/playerbots-bare.git/
